  "problem": "Consider the **orthonormal** set $U$ below. By adding a new vector $x=[{x}_{1},\\,{x}_{2}]^{T},$ extend the set so that it forms an **orthonormal** basis of ${R}^{2}.$ What is the value of $|{x}_{1}|+|{x}_{2}|?$\n\n$$\nU=\\{[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5}\\end{aligned}]\\}\n$$",
